      "content": "everything just feels so pointless. like why even bother trying to find more therapy or more \"support\" when the end result is always the same? you wake up, you perform, you go through the motions, and you realize you're still just an outsider. it's like living in a room with no doors. i just keep thinking about what would happen if i didn't have to do this anymore. if i could just finally have some actual quiet.",
